# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file: findings we have checked and accepted, each with why.
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-FFLATE-22392372:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Not reachable. The flaw is in fflate's ZIP extraction (unzipSync), which
          allocates whatever uncompressed size a crafted ZIP entry declares. This
          package never extracts ZIP: the snapshot only compresses (zlibSync), and the
          renderer inflates an image's zlib data (unzlibSync) into a buffer of exactly
          width x height x 4 bytes, after @btps/sdk has measured it to that length
          (png.ts, png.test.ts). No fixed fflate exists yet: when this expires, check
          for one.
        expires: 2027-02-15T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
